 ],
 "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says the API Gateway CloudWatch log group is encrypted with a second CMK, but the GT has the second KMS key (with a logs principal) and no AWS::Logs::LogGroup at all; logs_key accepts a log group using a CMK or a key whose policy names the Logs service, and the log group itself is not required. Key policy 'only these functions' is tested as a Decrypt statement naming a function, role or the Lambda service; a root kms:* statement alongside it is not rejected because the GT has one. The DynamoDB table need not be created by the template: the GT only names it. IAM checks are bound to the role trusting lambda.amazonaws.com; API Gateway logging to the role trusting apigateway.amazonaws.com. Review 2026-11-10: out_wss also accepts an output of the API's ApiEndpoint attribute (the wss:// URL); invoke_every_route's wildcard SourceArn branch also matches a Fn::Join ending in /*; IAM checks accept AWS::IAM::RolePolicy."
}
